title: "VetPathDB"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-05-29"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dimolabuol/vetpathdb"
abstract: >-
  VetPathDB is an open-source platform for extracting structured data
  from veterinary pathology PDF reports using large language models,
  with AI-powered semantic search for case retrieval.
